Is everything all right? You must have felt the last tremors at the bottom of the sea too. While you were away, Midranda captured the Guardians of the Eastern and Southern Continents. With the help of the Priestess Zandaka, we managed to free them.

Thank you very much for bringing a sample of the Insane Faugn.
I also got the samples collected by Arteres and Ceres.
Its skin is different; you can feel a wild power coming from it.

I will need some time to study these samples.
Please, come back later.
